---
title: Deploy Template - Two-Job Pattern
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph "Job 1: Submit & Wait"
        NOTIFY_START[Teams: Deploy started]
        TOOLS1[Install Power Platform Tools]
        WHOAMI[Validate Service Connection<br/>PowerPlatformWhoAmi]
        READY{Environment Ready?}
        POLL_READY[Poll PPAC API<br/>every 30s, up to 30 min]
        DEPLOY[PowerPlatformDeployPackage<br/>Synchronous wait up to 3h]
    end

    subgraph "Job 2: Verify"
        TOOLS2[Install Power Platform Tools]
        TOKEN[Acquire PPAC Management API token]
        RESOLVE[Resolve environment GUID<br/>from service connection]
        QUERY[Query latest operation<br/>api.powerplatform.com]
        EVAL{Operation State?}
        SUCCESS[Stage passes]
        FAIL[Stage fails<br/>Blocks downstream]
        NOTIFY_OK[Teams: Deploy succeeded]
        NOTIFY_FAIL[Teams: Deploy failed]
    end

    NOTIFY_START --> TOOLS1
    TOOLS1 --> WHOAMI
    WHOAMI --> READY
    READY -->|Not Ready / Servicing| POLL_READY
    POLL_READY --> READY
    READY -->|Ready| DEPLOY

    DEPLOY -->|Job 2 starts| TOOLS2
    TOOLS2 --> TOKEN
    TOKEN --> RESOLVE
    RESOLVE --> QUERY
    QUERY --> EVAL
    EVAL -->|Succeeded / Completed| SUCCESS
    EVAL -->|Running / Queued| FAIL
    EVAL -->|Failed / Other| FAIL
    SUCCESS --> NOTIFY_OK
    FAIL --> NOTIFY_FAIL

    style READY fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style EVAL fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ff9800
    style SUCCESS fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#4caf50
    style FAIL fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#f44336
    style DEPLOY fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#2196f3
